        {
          "book": "DAN",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "In the third year of the reign of King Belshazzar, a vision appeared to me, even to me, Daniel, after that which appeared to me at the first.",
      "ko": "나 다니엘에게 처음에 나타난 이상 후 벨사살왕 삼년에 다시 이상이 나타나니라",
      "source_text_hash": "2250fbcdac4539d27fb0b4149582519e219dbef9f022f24bb9cffc84ec1e8e06",
      "translation_text_hash": "fb3a10ee77501c2ec60f7e38785d0bdbb95746a4a9a3320c57d0a0c539aec0f9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "나 다니엘에게 처음에 나타난 이상 후 벨사살왕 삼년에 다시 이상이 나타나니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "fb3a10ee77501c2ec60f7e38785d0bdbb95746a4a9a3320c57d0a0c539aec0f9"
      ]
