      "en": "As for that which was broken, in the place where four stood up, four kingdoms will stand up out of the nation, but not with his power.",
      "ko": "이 뿔이 꺾이고 그 대신에 네 뿔이 났은즉 그 나라 가운데서 네 나라가 일어나되 그 권세만 못하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "47ee3d525660d255d90fe4e7f0a66c33d7c63d6ac4d2939611ed30c07cc5f7ea",
      "translation_text_hash": "5946193866daf4cfcc6adff14321adf0fd47bc8505de2531770aaafd78d3cba7",
