      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "DAN",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 25
        }
      ],
      "en": "Through his policy he will cause deceit to prosper in his hand. He will magnify himself in his heart, and he will destroy many in their security. He will also stand up against the prince of princes, but he will be broken without human hands.",
      "ko": "그가 꾀를 베풀어 제 손으로 궤휼을 이루고 마음에 스스로 큰체하며 또 평화한 때에 많은 무리를 멸하며 또 스스로 서서 만왕의 왕을 대적할 것이나 그가 사람의 손을 말미암지 않고 깨어지리라",
      "source_text_hash": "9442101db3e27d1bd46b87e34dce651418a82a756d9bab8abc92814586c9db49",
      "translation_text_hash": "ea330c20e4d91be07590db06789f4b261e85bf54dc5a7142d28b3a517eb921af",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
